    <section class="section tint">
      <div class="shell registry-preview">
        <div class="registry-copy"><div class="section-kicker">Example record</div><h2 class="section-title">Lightweight in search. Self-contained in the public profile.</h2><p class="section-copy">A Registry result establishes identity, verification status, record version, and approved links without exposing the private Truth Canon or pretending to be an independent rating.</p></div>
        <article class="registry-card"><div class="registry-card-head"><div class="registry-title"><span class="record-mark">N</span><div><strong>Northstar Logistics Inc.</strong><small>Transportation and logistics · Canada</small></div></div><span class="status-badge">Verified record</span></div><div class="registry-facts"><div class="registry-fact"><span>Domain ownership</span><strong>Confirmed</strong></div><div class="registry-fact"><span>Record version</span><strong>V1.4</strong></div><div class="registry-fact"><span>Supporting sources</span><strong>4 reviewed</strong></div></div><p class="registry-source"><strong>Published Registry Profile:</strong> Legal name, primary domain, headquarters, operating market, core offerings, and approved public source links. The private Canon and internal evidence ledger remain controlled artifacts.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button-secondary" href="#">View public profile preview</a></div></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="shell"><div class="section-head center"><div class="section-kicker">What verification means</div><h2 class="section-title">A governed process statement, not a promotion.</h2></div><div class="three-grid"><article class="info-card"><span class="card-icon">01</span><h3>Identity control confirmed</h3><p>The organization controls the primary domain associated with the public record.</p></article><article class="info-card"><span class="card-icon">02</span><h3>Canon and evidence approved</h3><p>Public facts derive from the customer-confirmed Canon. Evidence-required claims pass authority-grade review before publication.</p></article><article class="info-card"><span class="card-icon">03</span><h3>No ranking implication</h3><p>Verification is not an endorsement, ranking advantage, or guarantee of inclusion in an AI-generated answer.</p></article></div><div class="method-note"><strong>Publication gate:</strong> VizAI prepares and reviews the record before the clean public profile is released or updated.</div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="shell final-cta"><div><h2>Create and approve the private Canon before publishing the listing.</h2><p>The public Registry Profile is a clean Canon-derived artifact; it does not replace or expose the governed source of truth behind it.</p></div><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/packages">Explore the Build</a><a class="button-secondary" href="/contact">Ask about verification</a></div></section>
